tk1FllOjqHoQ7kNvwFSLG4A&_nc_oc=AdqnWwYmQCx2xog6L-DxXPIojIFrfCNYencBmm2bzLjSNRM1n1n0YFx4YZ3uOsrPsdU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLWYsWDjhnWy9HHQo2qt7J9GF3pBY5dFw-ZYRe8hxyprw&oe=6ABE6AB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C8f3FdoTc58Q7kNvwFBPMs3&_nc_oc=Adrf1b4MdESMYq6H27_P80v1IPEIU_a0TulFksnIWpQiAwY32oLOKNrE9Ie1smzhPhw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKSd1Pifc4sczj6OdK0GCWPXz-D9u0MjZY3rUqDnmHPsA&oe=6ABE6C4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XoeRwqOX33sQ7kNvwF6od4G&_nc_oc=AdrjJ7kWWSArVyrCEtQF2tU95Se372mBJ7ORoyO28-LMqfoj46d4wHt8lMSHpanlFm0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK0JHxax_tdZ40zPHQSSMhCL-mPVreaLH0RCO9QTJ0_JA&oe=6ABE596F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U1FB6xrOnssQ7kNvwFG2cRq&_nc_oc=Adpbe0IxukQaubQnWtOrOZDmx0hkJzdnSYl4X5x8vkGDPIxVSNQZkzmAdHiZhA4p1pI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIDXTddKsMfwiv7_Hx44PgOcvpu28w4y4-qNeyE_FcsJw&oe=6ABE7B03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gRM1Q7iboDAQ7kNvwEc0DS9&_nc_oc=Adoc-h4DTtI3KUuDHOPpL_VG16J-79q9QnhiXczLYNaZUOoQozDBoKB-BV87rju0yWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGzuHH1YRNjr6zTLGVm3gCF8lL3zuv4123lUxJFRtCuA&oe=6ABE7358"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=unXL8nZMCmYQ7kNvwGBBb34&_nc_oc=AdoqfrdeCCtdHduWXRE8khtIKTcsxyPI5gRrIn8ic2ChDMp6gdMzR47R69kvJabcq98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJCaKyLXjzklrXKHV_UIHRFs-F22XyQNl2IxYXczUg1qw&oe=6ABE867C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080